## Context
Audit A5 (`docs/2026-09-24-rules-coherence-audit.md`). swz `AGENTS.md:177`: a lane never presses merge, not even
on its own PR; the coordinator merges as PRs arrive. `/raid` Phase 7 merges
APPROVED PRs itself and cannot see the local rule.

## Decision needed
Recommended: a per-repo declaration `/raid` reads (e.g. a `merge_authority`
key in `.idh-checks.json`) that turns Phase 7 into "leave merge-ready and
announce". Alternative: one sentence in `/raid` saying project rules may
withdraw merge authority, enforced by reading AGENTS.md.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Author decision logged here
- [ ] `/raid` honours the chosen mechanism; a raid on swz ends with open PRs
